{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"ActionDock API","version":"0.2.0","description":"ActionDock is a human-in-the-loop approval gateway for AI-agent API writes: an MCP server and HTTP API that puts deterministic policy, owner approval of the exact request, and server-held credentials between an agent's tool call and a real API write. Official MCP server: https://actiondock.app/mcp (remote Streamable HTTP — nothing to install). ActionDock (actiondock.app) is unrelated to the `actiondock` and `@actiondock/*` packages on npm and to “Action Dock” boat-lift or loading-dock businesses. Authenticated operations require a workspace API key; every external write waits as awaiting_approval until a signed-in workspace owner releases the exact preview."},"servers":[{"url":"https://actiondock.app"}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"paths":{"/health":{"get":{"summary":"Service health","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Healthy","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Health"}}}},"503":{"description":"Database unavailable","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Health"}}}}}}},"/v1/manifest":{"get":{"summary":"Machine-readable agent manifest","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Agent manifest","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}}}}},"/openapi.json":{"get":{"summary":"This OpenAPI document","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OpenAPI 3.1 document","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}}}}},"/server.json":{"get":{"summary":"MCP registry server metadata","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"server.json (schema 2025-12-11)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}}}}},"/.well-known/mcp/server.json":{"get":{"summary":"MCP registry server metadata (well-known location)","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"server.json (schema 2025-12-11)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}}}}},"/llms.txt":{"get":{"summary":"llms.txt index for language-model crawlers","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Markdown index","content":{"text/plain":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}}}},"/skill.md":{"get":{"summary":"Portable Agent Skill","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"SKILL.md","content":{"text/markdown":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}}}},"/v1/signup":{"post":{"summary":"Start a subscription signup and receive a hosted checkout URL","security":[],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SignupRequest"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Signup created","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SignupResult"}}}},"400":{"description":"Request body is invalid.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/signup/{claimToken}":{"get":{"summary":"Check whether a signup is ready to claim","security":[],"parameters":[{"name":"claimToken","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Signup status","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SignupStatus"}}}}}}},"/v1/signup/{claimToken}/claim":{"post":{"summary":"Claim a paid signup and receive the first workspace API key","security":[],"parameters":[{"name":"claimToken","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"API key shown once; a dashboard session cookie is also set","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CreatedApiKey"}}}},"404":{"description":"Unknown, expired, or already claimed token.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/actions":{"get":{"summary":"List available actions","responses":{"200":{"description":"Action catalog","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["actions"],"properties":{"actions":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ActionCatalogEntry"}}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/actions/{action}":{"post":{"summary":"Submit one bounded action","description":"Returns 202 with a durable job. Actions with sideEffect true start as awaiting_approval and execute only after a signed-in workspace owner releases the exact preview in the dashboard; other actions start as queued. integration.execute optionally accepts input.executeBefore, a UTC latest-dispatch timestamp bound to approval; expired writes fail without dispatch and need a new proposal and approval. Already-sent writes may finish later. It also accepts input.ifMatch, a single strong quoted ETag bound to approval and sent as If-Match. A provider 412 fails the job without retry and requires a fresh read and new proposal; the provider must enforce conditional writes. See each action's inputSchema in the action catalog.","parameters":[{"name":"action","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["document.analyze","data.extract","data.validate","research.web","integration.fetch","integration.execute","report.create"]}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"description":"Deduplicates this submission within the workspace; it does not guarantee exactly-once execution by the provider.","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ActionSubmission"}}}},"responses":{"202":{"description":"Job accepted","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Job"}}}},"400":{"description":"Action input is invalid (invalid_action_input).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"402":{"description":"Subscription or processing limit blocks new work.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Idempotency key was already used for a different request (idempotency_conflict).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/jobs":{"get":{"summary":"List recent jobs and workflow metadata","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Maximum number of records to return (default 50).","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Job list","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["jobs"],"properties":{"jobs":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Job"}}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/jobs/{jobId}":{"get":{"summary":"Get a job","parameters":[{"name":"jobId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Job state and result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Job"},"examples":{"awaitingApproval":{"summary":"integration.execute waiting for a signed-in owner to release the exact preview at https://actiondock.app/dashboard","value":{"id":"8c3f1d2e-6b4a-4f0e-9a1b-2c3d4e5f6a7b","workspaceId":"0f7c9a2b-1d3e-4c5f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5b","action":"integration.execute","workflowId":"crm-account-42","workflowName":"Approved CRM update","input":{"connectionId":"5b1e2f3a-4c6d-4e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b","method":"PATCH","path":"/accounts/42","body":{"reviewStatus":"approved"}},"sideEffect":true,"idempotencyKey":"crm-account-42-update-v1","rejectedAt":null,"rejectedBy":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:00:00.000Z","status":"awaiting_approval","output":{"kind":"approved_api_write","connectionId":"5b1e2f3a-4c6d-4e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b","connectionVersion":3,"connectionName":"CRM production","baseUrl":"https://api.crm.example/v2/","targetUrl":"https://api.crm.example/v2/accounts/42","method":"PATCH","path":"/accounts/42","query":{},"body":{"reviewStatus":"approved"},"writePolicyMode":"manual_only","reasonablenessPolicyConfigured":false},"error":null,"approvedAt":null,"approvedBy":null,"updatedAt":"2026-09-10T09:00:00.000Z"}},"executionUnknown":{"summary":"Approved write whose outcome is ambiguous; stop blind retry and reconcile the provider before submitting again","value":{"id":"8c3f1d2e-6b4a-4f0e-9a1b-2c3d4e5f6a7b","workspaceId":"0f7c9a2b-1d3e-4c5f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5b","action":"integration.execute","workflowId":"crm-account-42","workflowName":"Approved CRM update","input":{"connectionId":"5b1e2f3a-4c6d-4e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b","method":"PATCH","path":"/accounts/42","body":{"reviewStatus":"approved"}},"sideEffect":true,"idempotencyKey":"crm-account-42-update-v1","rejectedAt":null,"rejectedBy":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:00:00.000Z","status":"execution_unknown","output":{"kind":"approved_api_write","connectionId":"5b1e2f3a-4c6d-4e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b","connectionVersion":3,"connectionName":"CRM production","baseUrl":"https://api.crm.example/v2/","targetUrl":"https://api.crm.example/v2/accounts/42","method":"PATCH","path":"/accounts/42","query":{},"body":{"reviewStatus":"approved"},"writePolicyMode":"manual_only","reasonablenessPolicyConfigured":false},"error":"The external API may have accepted this write. Reconcile its state before submitting another request.","approvedAt":"2026-09-10T09:04:12.000Z","approvedBy":"owner@example.com","updatedAt":"2026-09-10T09:04:27.000Z"}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/jobs/{jobId}/reconciliations":{"get":{"summary":"Read owner-reported evidence for an unknown write","description":"Append-only observations, newest first. Does not change the job state, independently verify provider state, or authorize a retry.","parameters":[{"name":"jobId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","description":"Maximum observations per page, newest first.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":20}},{"name":"before","in":"query","description":"nextBefore from the previous page. Omit for newest records; positive signed BIGINT decimal.","schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[1-9][0-9]{0,18}$"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Owner observations","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReconciliationPage"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid pagination query.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/dashboard/jobs":{"get":{"summary":"Browse the signed-in owner's jobs by status","description":"The signed-in owner can filter Workflows and jobs by status and load older jobs, including approvals and execution_unknown records outside the recent overview. GET /v1/dashboard/jobs accepts status, limit (1-100, default 50), and a before job UUID; follow nextBefore until null. Results are newest first by creation time and ID, scoped to the owner workspace. These are live pages, not a snapshot; refresh to see new jobs or changed statuses. Agent API keys cannot use this owner endpoint; MCP tools and agent job reads keep their existing contracts.","security":[{"dashboardSession":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"status","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["awaiting_approval","queued","running","succeeded","failed","rejected","execution_unknown"]},"description":"Omit for all statuses. Filtering happens before pagination."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":50}},{"name":"before","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"description":"Use nextBefore from the previous page with the same status filter. The cursor remains valid if that job changes status. A missing or foreign cursor returns 404; restart without it."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Matching jobs, newest first; no state change or provider call","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["jobs","nextBefore"],"properties":{"jobs":{"type":"array","maxItems":100,"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Job"}},"nextBefore":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Older-page cursor, or null when no further matching jobs were found."}}}}},"headers":{"Cache-Control":{"schema":{"type":"string","const":"no-store"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid status, limit or cursor.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A signed-in owner session is required; API keys are not accepted.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Cursor job not found in this workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/dashboard/callback-deliveries/{deliveryId}/retry":{"post":{"summary":"Queue a failed callback notification for another delivery cycle","description":"Only the signed-in owner can retry a failed callback notification to the current configured receiver. An enabled callback is required. Retry queues a new bounded delivery cycle; it never reruns the job or changes execution_unknown. Event and delivery IDs stay stable; verify the signature and deduplicate X-ActionDock-Delivery. Delivery is at least once, and polling remains available. Agent API keys and MCP tools cannot retry notifications. Requires the owner session and same-origin Origin header. HTTP 202 confirms durable queueing, not receipt by the receiver. Automatic failure retries stop after eight attempts per cycle; startup recovery may repeat an interrupted attempt. attempts resets to zero while the previous HTTP/error result remains until the next result. The original envelope is sent using the current callback URL and secret. Settings changes do not cancel an already-sent notification.","security":[{"dashboardSession":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"deliveryId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"Origin","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"The ActionDock instance origin."}],"responses":{"202":{"description":"Notification durably queued; the business job is unchanged","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["retried"],"properties":{"retried":{"type":"boolean","const":true}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid delivery UUID.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A signed-in owner session is required; API keys are not accepted.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"Missing or cross-origin Origin header.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Callback delivery not found in this workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"callback_retry_unavailable: delivery is not failed, or its callback is missing or disabled. Refresh before deciding whether to retry.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/dashboard/jobs/{jobId}/export":{"get":{"summary":"Download the signed-in owner's evidence for one job","description":"For a support handoff, direct the signed-in owner to Download job evidence on the dashboard job. GET /v1/dashboard/jobs/{jobId}/export requires the owner session, not an agent API key. The JSON contains that job and up to 1,000 of its newest stored job events and owner observations per collection, with truncation flags. It is not signed or independent provider verification and never replays a request. Events may lag job updates. Review sensitive content before sharing.","security":[{"dashboardSession":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"jobId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Stored job evidence from one database snapshot; no provider call","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JobEvidence"}}},"headers":{"Content-Disposition":{"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Attachment named actiondock-job-<jobId>.json."},"Cache-Control":{"schema":{"type":"string","const":"no-store"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid job UUID.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A signed-in owner session is required; API keys are not accepted.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Job not found in this workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/dashboard/jobs/{jobId}/reconciliations":{"get":{"summary":"Read reconciliation history as the signed-in owner","security":[{"dashboardSession":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"jobId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","description":"Maximum observations per page, newest first.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":20}},{"name":"before","in":"query","description":"nextBefore from the previous page. Omit for newest records; positive signed BIGINT decimal.","schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[1-9][0-9]{0,18}$"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Owner observations","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReconciliationPage"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid pagination query.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"post":{"summary":"Append an owner observation to an execution_unknown write","description":"Requires the signed-in owner session and same-origin Origin header; API keys cannot write observations. Reuse the client UUID and content after an uncertain save. A correction requires a new UUID. No job transition, provider request, or callback is triggered. Reference text is never fetched.","security":[{"dashboardSession":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"jobId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"Origin","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"The ActionDock instance origin."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReconciliationInput"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Saved observation (including identical retries)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Reconciliation"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid evidence or unexpected input field.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"Cross-origin request forbidden.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Job is not an unknown write, or observation ID was reused with different content.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/connections":{"get":{"summary":"List approved API connections without credentials","responses":{"200":{"description":"Connection metadata","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["connections"],"properties":{"connections":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Connection"}}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/events":{"get":{"summary":"List job and callback events","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Maximum number of records to return (default 50).","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Event list","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["events"],"properties":{"events":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JobEvent"}}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/usage":{"get":{"summary":"List metered internal service usage","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Maximum number of records to return (default 50).","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Usage records","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["summary","records"],"properties":{"summary":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UsageSummary"},"records":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UsageRecord"}}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/artifacts":{"get":{"summary":"List report artifacts and storage usage","responses":{"200":{"description":"Report artifacts","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["artifacts","usage"],"properties":{"artifacts":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Artifact"}},"usage":{"type":"object","required":["bytes","files","quotaBytes"],"properties":{"bytes":{"type":"integer"},"files":{"type":"integer"},"quotaBytes":{"type":"integer"}}}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/artifacts/{artifactId}":{"get":{"summary":"Download one report artifact","parameters":[{"name":"artifactId","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Artifact id from GET /v1/artifacts, for example <uuid>.md.","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Artifact content","content":{"text/markdown":{"schema":{"type":"string"}},"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"delete":{"summary":"Delete one report artifact","parameters":[{"name":"artifactId","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Artifact id from GET /v1/artifacts, for example <uuid>.md.","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"204":{"description":"Artifact deleted"},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/billing":{"get":{"summary":"Get the workspace subscription, processing limit, and storage snapshot","responses":{"200":{"description":"Billing snapshot","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BillingSnapshot"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/v1/billing/portal":{"get":{"summary":"Get a fresh subscription-management portal URL","responses":{"200":{"description":"Customer portal URL","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PortalUrl"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/mcp":{"post":{"summary":"MCP Streamable HTTP endpoint","description":"JSON-RPC 2.0 messages for the Model Context Protocol. Tools: list_actions, list_connections, run_action, get_job, wait_for_job, list_job_reconciliations, list_events, list_usage. GET and DELETE return 405; sessions are stateless.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","description":"JSON-RPC 2.0 request"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"JSON-RPC 2.0 response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","description":"JSON-RPC 2.0 response"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing, invalid, or revoked workspace API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found or outside the caller's workspace.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded (rate_limit_exceeded).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}}},"components":{"securitySchemes":{"dashboardSession":{"type":"apiKey","in":"cookie","name":"actiondock_dashboard","description":"Signed-in workspace owner session; cannot be replaced with an agent API key."},"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","description":"Workspace API key created in the dashboard. Send Authorization: Bearer <ACTIONDOCK_API_KEY>."}},"schemas":{"JobEvidence":{"type":"object","properties":{"schemaVersion":{"type":"number","const":1},"exportedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"Export start time; job and history use one database snapshot."},"job":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"Job identifier."},"workspaceId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"Workspace that owns the job."},"action":{"type":"string","description":"Catalog action name, for example integration.execute."},"workflowId":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Caller-supplied workflow identifier shared across related jobs."},"workflowName":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Caller-supplied workflow name shown in the dashboard."},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["awaiting_approval","queued","running","succeeded","failed","rejected","execution_unknown"],"description":"awaiting_approval, queued, and running are non-terminal; succeeded, failed, rejected, and execution_unknown are terminal. An owner may revoke a queued approval, producing rejected with both approval and rejection evidence."},"input":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{},"description":"Validated action input exactly as submitted."},"output":{"description":"For writes awaiting_approval or queued: the exact approval preview bound to the owner's decision. Rejected writes retain that preview, including after a queued approval is revoked. After succeeded: the action result. After execution_unknown: the approved write plus the ambiguous provider response when one was received. Other jobs may have a preserved preview or null."},"error":{"anyOf":[{"ty